# Thornspire Verge: its {G} ability is offered only while you control a Mountain or a Forest (CR 602.5b). Alone it
# makes {R}; once a Forest is in play (a Mountain would do as well) it makes {G}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thornspire Verge
Forest
Plains x18

